Allternit USB Agent includes code adapted from esp32-iphone-agent
(https://github.com/onehumanbeing/esp32-iphone-agent), used under the MIT License:

  - firmware/usb_agent/usb_agent.ino   (from hardware/hid_bridge/hid_bridge.ino: paced pointer
                                        moves, key combos, USB wake handling, watchdog)
  - surfaces/allternit-desktop/src/main/phone-usb-agent-pointer.ts   (from server/hidagent/phone.py)
  - surfaces/allternit-desktop/src/main/phone-usb-agent-vision.ts    (from server/hidagent/vision.py)
  - surfaces/allternit-desktop/src/main/phone-airplay.ts             (approach of server/hidagent/screen.py)

Allternit added the authenticated USBA/1 protocol, provisioning over USB, the
arm button, the lease and auto-disarm, and the Desktop integration.

